@startuml
title Creazione issue — sequence diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #465DFF
actor Utente
participant "React CreateIssuePage" as UI
participant "Auth + Validator" as MW
participant IssueController
participant IssueService
participant IssueRepository
database "Neon PostgreSQL" as DB

Utente -> UI : compila titolo, descrizione, tipo, priorità
UI -> MW : POST /api/issues + Bearer JWT
MW -> MW : verifica JWT e schema Zod
MW -> IssueController : actor + DTO validato
IssueController -> IssueService : createIssue(actor, input)
IssueService -> IssueRepository : create(input, actor.id)
IssueRepository -> DB : INSERT parametrizzata
IssueRepository -> DB : SELECT issue + autore
DB --> IssueRepository : riga persistita
IssueRepository --> IssueService : Issue
IssueService --> IssueController : IssueDTO
IssueController --> UI : 201 Created
UI --> Utente : dettaglio e conferma
@enduml
